- Conversions: 19 → 16 (**−15.8%**)

Spend and conversions fell roughly in line, which is why CPA held steady rather than rising. The real story on Meta is **declining volume, not deteriorating efficiency**.

**Context from the other platforms (last week, 10/24–10/30)**
